*> vybe-test: cobol/add_advanced/test_add_decimals
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_add_advanced.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-A PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 1.25.
01 WS-B PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 2.50.
01 WS-C PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 0.0.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    ADD WS-A TO WS-B GIVING WS-C.
    DISPLAY WS-C.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-C DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "00375"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [00375] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

